<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="robots" content="noindex" /><title>og</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;background:#0d1117;color:#e6edf3;width:1200px;height:630px;overflow:hidden">
  <div style="padding:72px 80px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="font-size:22px;margin:0">devs --early-access · free</p>
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Manrope Variable',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:88px;line-height:1.02;margin:0;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Ship like you already<br /><span style="color:#58a6ff">have the job.</span></h1>
      <p style="font-size:30px;color:#9da7b3;margin:28px 0 0;max-width:960px">A practice engineering team for people learning to code. Tickets, pull requests, code review, sprints.</p>
    </div>
    <p style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:22px;color:#7d8590;margin:0"><span style="color:#3fb950">~/</span>devs · begindevs.com</p>
